The user experience and four bundled dist/media/*.mp4 clips originate from
NativeDog1/dsh-boot-animation (https://github.com/NativeDog1/dsh-boot-animation).
Upstream revision: 15ff124ff85cd23177d9b14dc81fae5c24adb8dc.
The library UI and stylesheet in ui/video-library.ts and ui/library-styles.ts
are adapted from the upstream src/client/ui.ts and src/client/styles.ts.
Modera-specific storage, playback and session APIs are connected by an adapter.

